    "sections": {
        "description": "Gutentype FSE is a modern and versatile WordPress theme built for the Gutenberg block editor, offering flexible layouts for a wide range of websites and online stores. With responsive designs, clean typography, and block-based customization, Gutentype FSE makes it easy to build professional websites without relying on complex page builders. The theme includes multiple shop layouts designed for different industries and product niches, including Fashion, Grocery, Jewelry, Electronics &amp; Gadgets, Shoes, Watches, Sportswear, Baby Products, Skincare, Modern Arts, and general-purpose stores. Built with Gutenberg blocks and flexible layouts, Gutentype FSE allows you to mix and match sections and create unique pages with ease. Its responsive design provides a consistent browsing experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Gutentype FSE is also WooCommerce-ready, making it a great choice for creating modern online stores with product-focused layouts and a clean, user-friendly shopping experience. Whether you are building a fashion shop, grocery store, jewelry website, electronics store, fashion boutique, or a general-purpose WooCommerce store, Gutentype FSE provides a flexible Gutenberg-based foundation for creating a modern WordPress website."
    },
